<title>USA: Alliance Pharmaceutical to receive payment.</title>
<headline>Alliance Pharmaceutical to receive payment.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alliance Pharmaceutical Corp said it will receive a developmental milestone payment of $15 million under its license agreement with Johnson &amp; Johnson affiliate Ortho Biotech Inc.</p>
<p>It said the milestone payment is being made based on an interim review of data from Phase II trials of its &quot;perflubron emulsion,&quot; a temporary blood substitute. It said it expects the Phase II trials to be completed in the first half of 1997.</p>
</text>
